# Applies to server/Dockerfile.prod only (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in
# preference to a root .dockerignore). That build's context is the repo root, so send
# just the two folders it copies, and never a machine's own node_modules or build
# output, which would overwrite what the image installed.
*
!server
!shared

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
